  "purpose": "Bind the resolved D9.8 editorial values and canonical presentation profile reference to the same D9.9 request/plan and D9.10 bridge identities for the supported content types. This is a non-persistent, renderer-agnostic identity receipt; it does not resolve presentation geometry or emit renderer input.",
